{"id":"msg-1780292922259-dw9d5k","type":"assistant","content":"轮岗在英语中通常翻译为 **\"rotation\"** 或 **\"job rotation\"**。\n\n根据具体语境，也可以说：\n- **Post rotation** — 岗位轮换\n- **Rotation program** — 轮岗项目\n- **Rotational assignment** — 轮岗派遣\n\n例如：\n- \"I'm participating in a rotation program.\"（我正在参加轮岗项目。）\n- \"She's on a post rotation to the overseas department.\"（她被轮岗到海外部门。）","timestamp":1780292922259,"isIntermediate":false,"turnId":"msg_e24b9dca-b78b-43c8-9d5f-0564e04a5e2e","thinkingLevel":"think"}
