{"id":"msg-1780293006957-8jqh2e","type":"assistant","content":"“我非常开心能在此刻见到你们”的英语翻译：\n\n**\"I'm very happy to see you all at this moment.\"**\n\n也可以根据语境表达为：\n- **\"I'm so glad to be here with you all today.\"**（更口语化、自然）\n- **\"It brings me great joy to see all of you here today.\"**（更正式、热情）\n- **\"I'm truly delighted to meet with you all at this time.\"**（更正式）","timestamp":1780293006957,"isIntermediate":false,"turnId":"msg_f254015d-5829-4e11-b796-c138f00d7da6","thinkingLevel":"think"}
